29
00:00:53.965 --> 00:00:55.565
Nineteen nineteen.

30
00:00:55.565 --> 00:00:57.225
Montagu Chelmsford.

31
00:00:57.225 --> 00:00:59.665
Dyarchy in the provinces:

32
00:00:59.665 --> 00:01:01.265
some subjects to Indian

33
